<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss government sets two-tranche bond tender.</title>
<headline>Swiss government sets two-tranche bond tender.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issues were announced by the Swiss Treasury and the Swiss National Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER - Swiss Government</p>
<p> AMT max 1.2 bln CHF  COUPON     5-1/2     MATURITY   06.Jan.05</p>
<p> TYPE   fixed-rate    ISS PRICE  *	   PAY DATE   07.Oct.96</p>
<p> LOCAL CODE 525 428  (Fungible with 322 523)</p>
<p>Tranche 2 -</p>
<p> BORROWER - Swiss Government</p>
<p> AMT  max 1.2 bln CHF COUPON     4-1/4     MATURITY   08.Jan.08</p>
<p> TYPE   fixed-rate    ISS PRICE  *	   PAY DATE   07.Oct.96</p>
<p>LOCAL CODE 525 437 (fungible with 108 546)</p>
<p>* Price will be announced after subscriptions close on September 26.</p>
<p>NOTE - Subscriptions close on September 26.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
